@url = http://localhost:4000/graphql

### Lista paginada, seleccion de campos y relacion Book.author
POST {{url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operationName": "ListBooks",
  "query": "query ListBooks($filter: BookFilterInput, $pagination: PaginationInput) { books(filter: $filter, pagination: $pagination) { items { id title status author { name } } pageInfo { page pageSize totalItems totalPages hasNextPage hasPreviousPage } } }",
  "variables": {
    "filter": {},
    "pagination": { "page": 1, "pageSize": 5 }
  }
}

### Consulta individual
POST {{url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operationName": "GetBook",
  "query": "query GetBook($id: ID!) { book(id: $id) { id title status author { name country } } }",
  "variables": { "id": "book-1" }
}

### Mutacion valida
POST {{url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operationName": "CreateBook",
  "query": "mutation CreateBook($input: CreateBookInput!) { createBook(input: $input) { id title isbn status author { name } } }",
  "variables": {
    "input": {
      "title": "GraphQL para clientes exigentes",
      "summary": "Ejemplo creado durante la demostracion de la API.",
      "isbn": "9780000000099",
      "publishedYear": 2026,
      "authorId": "author-2"
    }
  }
}

### Entrada invalida: se reciben errores comprensibles sin stack trace
POST {{url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operationName": "CreateBook",
  "query": "mutation CreateBook($input: CreateBookInput!) { createBook(input: $input) { id } }",
  "variables": {
    "input": { "title": "x", "isbn": "ABC", "authorId": "author-404" }
  }
}

### Relacion en ambos sentidos: Book.author y Author.books, un lote por direccion
POST {{url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operationName": "ListBooksWithSiblings",
  "query": "query ListBooksWithSiblings($pagination: PaginationInput) { books(pagination: $pagination) { items { id title author { name books(first: 2) { id title } } } } }",
  "variables": { "pagination": { "page": 1, "pageSize": 5 } }
}

### Limite de seguridad 1: pageSize maximo es 20
POST {{url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operationName": "ListBooks",
  "query": "query ListBooks($pagination: PaginationInput) { books(pagination: $pagination) { items { id } } }",
  "variables": { "pagination": { "page": 1, "pageSize": 21 } }
}

### Limite de seguridad 2: profundidad maxima de 8 niveles
POST {{url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operationName": "DeepQuery",
  "query": "query DeepQuery { books { items { author { books { author { books { author { books { id } } } } } } } } }",
  "variables": {}
}
